      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……没错，我表现得很完美。\n赢得比赛、唱歌、跳舞，然后继续赢──",
      "source_fingerprint": "655776bd825443a913d61caf26959fd4d3b97a33fb35901c969f27331c3bcf33",
