      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛的气氛越来越热烈，\n也开始能够独占趋势排行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1a6be24147299106df6aaf7f7a8a259f8ef74458e983cc2bd75baa99b32e8ab",
